 * 4. (Optional, if supported) Fetch the created section by its ID and confirm correctness of returned fields.
 *
 * Business logic checks:
 * - Foreign key to channel exists and is valid.
 * - Code and name for section are unique and correctly saved.
 * - All atomic fields (position, active) are stored as expected.
 * - Audit fields (created_at, updated_at) exist and are in correct ISO 8601 format.
 *
 * This test does not cover error cases or duplicate constraints – only the normal, successful flow with correct data and dependencies set up.
